<%@ Page Title="POPIA Privacy Policy" Language="C#" MasterPageFile="~/Site.Master" AutoEventWireup="true" CodeBehind="POPIA.aspx.cs" Inherits="Group_9.POPIA" %>

<asp:Content ID="Content1" ContentPlaceHolderID="MainContent" runat="server">
    <div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-md-10">
                <div class="card shadow-sm border-0">
                    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white text-center py-4">
                        <h2 class="mb-0">Protection of Personal Information (POPIA) Policy</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body p-5 text-dark">
                        
                        <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">1. Introduction</h4>
                        <p>Welcome to EasternDigital. As a digital marketplace dedicated to bridging the gap between talent and opportunity in the Eastern Cape, we are fully committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring your personal information is collected and used properly, transparently, and securely in accordance with the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA) of South Africa.</p>

                        <hr class="my-4" />

                        <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">2. What Information We Collect</h4>
                        <p>To connect students and service providers effectively, we collect the following information upon registration and profile creation:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Identity Data:</strong> Full names and user roles (Admin, Provider, or Client).</li>
                            <li><strong>Contact Data:</strong> Email addresses and telephone numbers.</li>
                            <li><strong>Location Data:</strong> General location details within the Eastern Cape to match local services (e.g., East London, Alice, Mthatha).</li>
                            <li><strong>Service Data:</strong> Details regarding the services you offer (e.g., tutoring, digital repairs) or services you book.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <hr class="my-4" />

                        <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">3. Why We Use Your Information</h4>
                        <p>EasternDigital will only use your personal information for the purposes for which it was collected. These include:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>To create and manage your secure digital account.</li>
                            <li>To facilitate communication between clients and service providers for the booking of services.</li>
                            <li>To send automated administrative emails (such as the password recovery emails sent by EasternDigital Support).</li>
                            <li>To verify the identity and status of service providers to maintain a safe community marketplace.</li>
                            <li>To track system analytics and audit logs to prevent fraud and unauthorized access.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <hr class="my-4" />

                        <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">4. Information Security</h4>
                        <p>We implement strict technical and organizational security measures to protect your data. Your passwords are securely managed, and direct database access is restricted strictly to authorized EasternDigital system administrators. We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to any third-party marketing companies.</p>

                        <hr class="my-4" />

                        <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">5. Your Rights as a User</h4>
                        <p>Under POPIA, you have the right to:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Request access to the personal information we hold about you.</li>
                            <li>Request the correction or deletion of inaccurate or outdated information.</li>
                            <li>Object to the processing of your personal information.</li>
                            <li>Request the permanent deactivation and deletion of your EasternDigital account.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <div class="alert alert-info mt-4" role="alert">
                            <strong>Contact Us:</strong> If you have any questions regarding this policy or wish to exercise your data rights, please contact our administrative team at <strong>dstixx809@gmail.com</strong>.
                        </div>

                        <div class="text-center mt-5">
                            <a href="Register.aspx" class="btn btn-outline-primary px-4 py-2 fw-bold">Return to Registration</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</asp:Content>
